sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Signed-in person
  participant S as Console
  participant O as Current email
  participant N as New email
  U->>S: New email and current password
  alt Password wrong or missing
    S-->>U: Refused, and limited to 5 tries in 15 minutes
  else Password correct
    S->>S: Saves it as pending. Sign-in stays on the current email
    S->>N: Confirmation link, works for 24 hours
    S->>O: Warning that a change was requested
    alt New address opens the link
      N->>S: Confirms
      S->>S: Email and username change, and every session ends
    else Nobody opens it
      S->>S: Nothing changes
    end
  end
